Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon Digital
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.04,0:00:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.78,0:01:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a dream of a dream. I'm\Na world without any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.12,0:01:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry. I'm a dream of winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.12,0:01:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm a stage. I'm not a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.12,0:01:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not a dream. I'm not\Na dream. I'm going to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.12,0:01:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.42,0:01:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy figured that's why\Nwe were the Digidestined,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.30,0:02:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that the Eighth Child must\Nhave seen the Digimon before,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.50,0:02:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.41,0:02:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hope we find the\Nkid before Myotismon does.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.56,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}The Great Digimon Crossing in Tokyo!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.94,0:02:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.85,0:02:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokyo Daiyoudan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.40,0:02:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're telling me Garudamon has\Nappeared in the real world? Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.78,0:02:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the Seven Children have returned\Nto the real world as well, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.74,0:02:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the eighth child\Nhas not been found yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.20,0:02:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No malignant one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.88,0:02:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not quite yet, but any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.80,0:02:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guaranteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.48,0:02:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're widening the search pattern\Neven as we speak. He's moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.50,0:02:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the kid's anywhere to\Nbe found, we'll find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.30,0:02:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're looking everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Air, land, and sea. We got\Nit covered. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.86,0:02:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,meanwhile we are not the\Nonly ones looking for him are
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.74,0:03:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we you don't make sure that\Nthose children don't fight him
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.72,0:03:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, can we get a snack\Nbefore we go looking? There's no
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.10,0:03:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time we've got to get to odiba\Nand find that eighth kid before
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.88,0:03:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,somebody else does how will\Nwe get there do you think
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.86,0:03:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there are any fast food places\Nalong the way would you knock
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.74,0:03:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it off about the food anyway\Nwe've only got enough money
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.90,0:03:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for our subway tickets subway\Noh well my parents won't let me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.72,0:03:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ride the subway by myself\Nyou're not by yourself now come
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.90,0:03:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on our subways like regular\Ntrains i mean do they have snack
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.64,0:03:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cars just drop it and stick\Ntogether everybody it can get
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kind of confusing down here i\Njust hope my otis man has as
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.96,0:03:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much trouble reading this map\Nas i do okay what do we do
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.20,0:03:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now besides starve to death\Ni'm just figuring it out okay
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.62,0:03:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that'll work now the fastest\Nroute to Odaiba is to take the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.60,0:03:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,number 12 train to Nagano and\Ntransfer to the Marinucci line,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.82,0:03:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then transfer
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.24,0:03:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to the Ginza line and get\Noff at Shinbashi. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:03:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds simple enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.78,0:04:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we just have to\Nfigure out the right fare.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.12,0:04:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.36,0:04:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you getting? A ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.70,0:04:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't ride the train
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.46,0:04:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.37,0:04:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's a ticket?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.29,0:04:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.20,0:04:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.12,0:04:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not another word out of\Nyou from now on, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.30,0:04:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want anybody seeing\Nyou and then asking a bunch
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.04,0:04:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of questions that we don't\Nwant to explain the answer to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.80,0:04:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, while we're here, you've got to\Npretend to be toys or stuffed animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.22,0:04:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But remember to keep still and no fidgeting.\NHere's an idea. I'll be one of those
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.76,0:04:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dolls you told me about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.98,0:04:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kind where you squeeze them\Nand they go, wah, wah, wah, wah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be a doll
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.82,0:04:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that doesn't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.73,0:04:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.32,0:04:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like being underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.36,0:04:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, put a lid on it.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.82,0:04:48.80,Sign,,0,52,182,,{\be1\bord0\c&H0D90F7&\b1}Out of Service{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.82,0:04:48.80,Sign,,0,52,222,,{\be1\bord0\c&H0D90F7&\b1}Shinjuku{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.56,0:04:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attention, attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.96,0:04:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Number 12 train now\Narriving at Platform 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.02,0:04:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.93,0:04:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd that voice come\Nfrom? You heard it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.66,0:04:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it's not just inside my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.02,0:04:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:04:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at those glowing eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.78,0:04:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's one of my oldest man's goons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.68,0:05:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.59,0:05:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.51,0:05:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't take you guys anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.70,0:05:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.18,0:05:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hush, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.48,0:05:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, take my seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.78,0:05:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.24,0:05:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wasn't that nice of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.94,0:05:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been on our feet\Nall day, haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.50,0:05:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, excuse me. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.88,0:05:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what are you doing now? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.36,0:05:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, honey. Let go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.32,0:05:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the girl's toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.66,0:05:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.24,0:05:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow, that's kind of hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.28,0:06:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.72,0:06:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of the girl's\Ntoy before you break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.18,0:06:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.98,0:06:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.89,0:06:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you let go of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.96,0:06:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess my toy didn't like when\Nyou pulled on him. You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.26,0:06:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That stuffed animal talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.72,0:06:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.18,0:06:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that practice is paying off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fooled him, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.52,0:06:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hush, just keep quiet and play along.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.28,0:06:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, the baby pulled your\Nhair because he likes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.24,0:06:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all. Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.14,0:06:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to bite\Nthe poor thing's head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.88,0:06:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm very sorry I shouted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.38,0:06:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See that, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.58,0:06:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's just making it look\Nlike the doll is talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.02,0:06:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called ventriloquism.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.26,0:06:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.68,0:06:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, what's the doll talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.06,0:07:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy, give me that toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.58,0:07:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want that doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.68,0:07:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't get one right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.56,0:07:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll start screaming at the top\Nof my bones. Excuse me, young
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.80,0:07:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lady Can I ask where you bought\Nthat doll I need one right away
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.40,0:07:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where I bought it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.40,0:07:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that hard a\Nquestion is it Come on you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.54,0:07:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be doing me a big favor\NWhere did you find it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.38,0:07:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stop is Nerima Please watch\Nyour step Again this stop is Nerima
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.18,0:07:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Nerima Department Store? What? Nerima?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.44,0:07:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot Come on, son Thanks again
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.62,0:07:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.00,0:08:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.40,0:08:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty weird how nuts that\Nkid went over Yokomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.00,0:08:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't find the eighth\Nchild, we could go into the...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.72,0:08:12.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toy business?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.04,0:08:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much longer? Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.56,0:08:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone wake me when we get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.38,0:08:18.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.88,0:08:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the name of the stop\Nwhere we're getting off again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.98,0:08:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We get off in Nagano.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.18,0:08:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay. Nagano.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.08,0:08:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stop is Nagano.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.76,0:08:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.56,0:08:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again, this stop is Nagano.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.32,0:08:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Pop?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.36,0:08:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, here's our stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.04,0:08:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're supposed to be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.70,0:08:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shinjuku, this stop, the end of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.80,0:09:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last stop, Shinjuku, please exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.68,0:09:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, huh? What? How'd we\Nmiss our stop, all of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.98,0:09:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,slept right through it\NPatamon you were awake
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.90,0:09:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sure what's wrong with\Nyou why didn't you wake
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.00,0:09:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us up how could I you told\Nus not to make a sound
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.00,0:09:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what now go back to our\Nstop no it's out of our way
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.86,0:09:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I think we can change\Ntrains here and be okay
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.44,0:09:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much longer? I'm\Ngetting awful hungry, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.80,0:09:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah i'm starving famished it can wait hey
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.04,0:09:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm hungry too you know i keep visualizing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.96,0:09:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cheeseburgers and i don't\Neven eat cheeseburgers
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.42,0:09:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it has been a long time\Nsince any of us have eaten
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.14,0:09:56.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And our Digimon get weak\Nwhen they're hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.76,0:10:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.80,0:10:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is a zoo and\Nnot a restaurant in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.28,0:10:11.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first one to see someplace\Nto eat, give a shout, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.98,0:10:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.89,0:10:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, can I get some ice cream?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.90,0:10:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, um, hey, Izzy. What\Nis it? You see something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.26,0:10:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other guys, they're gone. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.86,0:10:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this. They ditched us.\NOkay, okay, don't panic. As long as we
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.60,0:10:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have this we can always find them\Nhuh that's funny why isn't it working
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.62,0:10:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you think something might have happened\Nto it when we came back to the real
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.82,0:10:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world all i know is this is one of\Nthose days when everything goes wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.48,0:10:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.38,0:10:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry. Precept?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.62,0:10:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.54,0:10:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad dog! Bad dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.02,0:10:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.94,0:11:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.80,0:11:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're eating without us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.42,0:11:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like a new woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.06,0:11:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, it tastes great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.02,0:11:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yum-alicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.28,0:11:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, I sure needed this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.66,0:11:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You people are lucky. Yum-yum.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.18,0:11:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get to eat this stuff every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.50,0:11:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little hour, why don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.84,0:11:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a couple of people\Nthat aren't staring yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.14,0:11:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, nobody noticed\Nyet, but Matt's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.72,0:11:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.80,0:11:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.84,0:11:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.75,0:11:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, Izzy, well, it's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.26,0:12:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you guys waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Order something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.52,0:12:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.43,0:12:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you guys have got all the money, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.98,0:12:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoops, we went and spent it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.56,0:12:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, we were all so hungry, we\Nordered the super-duper combos.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.06,0:12:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, you spent it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.46,0:12:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was all the money\Nwe had in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the dumb, greedy, selfish\Nlittle things, it's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.46,0:12:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are supposed to be my\Nfriends, my friends, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.82,0:12:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.14,0:12:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the Digivice is responding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.28,0:12:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why wouldn't it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.66,0:12:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it wasn't working at all when\NI tried it in the station. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.70,0:12:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess in this world they only\Nfunction at a close distance
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.44,0:12:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great, but meanwhile,\Nwhat are we going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.84,0:12:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We start walking,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.02,0:12:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they won't let us back on\Nthe train without any money
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.18,0:12:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure not looking forward\Nto walking all that way Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.06,0:12:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know a way that won't cost us a penny\NJust leave everything to me Oh, great,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.98,0:12:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're a genius Help, please,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.14,0:13:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my cat is stuck in a tree\Nin Odaiba And I've got
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.44,0:13:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to get there right away\Nso I can get her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.78,0:13:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! The police?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.20,0:13:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's his brilliant idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.70,0:13:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the police do stop, they'll lock\Nhim up for disturbing the peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.84,0:13:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I've got the right-of-way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.56,0:13:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking good, Tai. Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.50,0:13:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, we could\Nbe sitting here all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.46,0:13:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.37,0:13:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you try to get us a ride. Me? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.94,0:13:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you, Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.85,0:13:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you're so smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.24,0:13:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.16,0:13:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T-Taxi! T-Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.82,0:13:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T-Taxi! T-Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.92,0:13:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T-Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.83,0:13:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T-Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.75,0:13:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T-Taxi! T-Taxi! You got any money?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.34,0:13:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.54,0:13:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.90,0:13:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.98,0:14:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You too, boys. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.70,0:14:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,School, you're gonna be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.54,0:14:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so easy, is it, Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.36,0:14:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at least my cat's\Nnot stuck in a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.68,0:14:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Girl power!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.26,0:14:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are the odds of that happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.16,0:14:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One in 4.2 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.78,0:14:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever, I'm just glad we have a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.84,0:14:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but what's a\Ncousin? Skip it. Sora?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.12,0:14:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.92,0:14:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her cousin?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.83,0:14:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a lift? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.74,0:14:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.48,0:14:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Girl power!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.42,0:14:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, here's the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.94,0:14:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna say this once, so listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.12,0:14:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.03,0:14:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dig it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.95,0:14:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're only here because\NSora is my cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.02,0:14:48.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're like our luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.06,0:14:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're like your luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.22,0:14:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And luggage doesn't make a sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.20,0:14:54.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.11,0:14:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or else it's liable to get itself\Nthrown out of the car, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.88,0:14:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.96,0:14:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luggage doesn't make a sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.10,0:15:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want some gum? Sugarless?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.96,0:15:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, sure. How about you,\NSora? Thanks, Dwayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.04,0:15:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.18,0:15:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sora, I think your\Ncousin's a major ramo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.22,0:15:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's sort of the black sheep of the thing,\Nbut he's giving us a lift, so be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.08,0:15:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will, but just make sure\Nhe takes us to Odaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.30,0:15:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.00,0:15:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did I ever get into this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.32,0:15:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knocking myself out searching\Nfor some pipsqueak kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.68,0:15:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got half a mind to chuck\Nthis whole lousy job!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.14,0:15:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the master might not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.16,0:16:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what's up, babe?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The radio's kind of loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.48,0:16:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tunes are kind of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.90,0:16:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Radio!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.12,0:16:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Radio? It's too loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.96,0:16:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe just a little!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.82,0:16:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now for a news update.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.22,0:16:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Officials have yet to find a clear\Nexplanation for the devastating explosion that
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rocked the Highton View Terrace apartments\Nin the Nerima District earlier today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.06,0:16:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Power in the area is still out,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.88,0:16:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the injured are still being\Ncounted after the bizarre incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.26,0:16:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While official sources have\Noffered no further information,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.00,0:16:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there are reports of\Nseveral eyewitness accounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.42,0:16:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, these accounts have only\Nserved to further mystify investigators.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.66,0:16:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The details of their accounts differ,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.74,0:16:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but several of these eyewitnesses\Nagree that an elephant and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.92,0:16:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something described as a giant\Nfirebird were seen in the vicinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.86,0:16:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A giant what? Firebird?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.54,0:16:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta love the crazies in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.76,0:16:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A similar incident took place at the Highton\NView Terrace Apartments four years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.90,0:16:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's unknown whether there is\Nany connection between the two.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.68,0:16:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.12,0:17:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.24,0:17:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not the guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.42,0:17:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.40,0:17:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coralmon, you couldn't wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.10,0:17:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, who did it? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.14,0:17:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one of you made a\Nmess of my new seat covers?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.94,0:17:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right here, I'm the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.26,0:17:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll clean it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.32,0:17:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll even detail it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.16,0:17:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't try covering up for these losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.66,0:17:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one of them was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.76,0:17:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, Mr. Peepers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.46,0:17:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was you, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.38,0:17:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.72,0:17:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.63,0:17:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pick up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.80,0:17:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.24,0:17:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.38,0:17:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.62,0:17:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not coming, is it? Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.52,0:17:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!\NDigimon! Digimon monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.56,0:17:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.70,0:17:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.80,0:17:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.38,0:18:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Muddy man! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.04,0:18:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got you, Izzy! No! Ah! Thanks, Tentomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.30,0:18:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, you had to have that extra\Nside of chili fries, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.66,0:18:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.66,0:18:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's Gesomon! It's what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.96,0:18:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gesomon!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.07,0:18:26.58,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Gesomon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.07,0:18:26.58,Sign,,370,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.07,0:18:26.58,Sign,,370,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.07,0:18:26.58,Sign,,370,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Mollusk Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.07,0:18:26.58,Sign,,370,0,305,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.07,0:18:26.58,Sign,,370,0,345,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Deadly Shade
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.06,0:18:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a bit of everything\Nnasty that lives underwater,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.62,0:18:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stick them together, and that's him! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.60,0:18:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get to run your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.08,0:18:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good riddance!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.99,0:18:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a lousy driver anyway! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.24,0:18:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.42,0:18:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.33,0:18:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.25,0:18:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.16,0:18:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions. Digimon, digital\Nmonsters. Digimon are the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.34,0:18:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gomamon, Digimon, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.40,0:18:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.64,0:18:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, I think we'll\Njust get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.86,0:19:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coral Crusher!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.30,0:19:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One for torpedoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.20,0:19:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy cow, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.96,0:19:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must be advertising something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.28,0:19:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Advertising something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.26,0:19:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.60,0:19:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're shooting a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.14,0:19:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see any cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.64,0:19:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, maybe they're just rehearsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so then you know what he said?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.80,0:19:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.26,0:19:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.82,0:19:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rough day at work, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.02,0:19:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, same old, same old.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.02,0:19:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My money's on the big hairy one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.60,0:20:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're gone. Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, did you guys see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.64,0:20:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zora?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.58,0:20:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zora!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.96,0:20:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd all those kids go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.36,0:20:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, so much for keeping a low profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.08,0:20:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least we got away from lame\NDwayne and we're all in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.00,0:20:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice work, Ikkakumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.60,0:20:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You nailed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.58,0:20:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.49,0:20:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wouldn't you rather travel in the\Nfresh air than under the ground
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.00,0:20:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that subway? Oh yeah, this is\Ngreat. And best of all, it's free.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.72,0:20:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here's good news now that they've shown\Nthemselves we can finally take care of them
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.54,0:20:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next stop home yeah i've\Ngot home does anybody have
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.94,0:20:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something to eat oh mimi not\Nthat again i was just asking
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.20,0:21:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you smiling? You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.72,0:22:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,la la la,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.32,0:22:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.32,0:23:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, the adventure evolves.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.02,0:23:04.94,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Raremon! Attack in Tokyo Bay

